moveit2: rclcpp/event_handler.hpp for rclcpp/qos_event.hpp

Several moveit_ros sources include <rclcpp/qos_event.hpp>, the name rclcpp
releases before Jazzy used; Jazzy's rclcpp (the ros2 component's) has only
<rclcpp/event_handler.hpp>, which declares the same QoS event handlers:
"rclcpp/qos_event.hpp: No such file or directory".

Upstream-Status: Pending
